{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"76621b5515c97116a5cac48f0b7c922b1e141253c04cea1f2c2e8b9fbda30c51","slug":"publish","location":"/guide/phase-5/publish.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Publish and Update Website","label":"lancarbon-phase5-publish","authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Haojie Dai","given":"Haojie","family":"Dai"},"name":"Haojie Dai","id":"contributors-Users\\HAOJIE~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\lancarbon-pages-build-V8URAy\\myst-generated-uid-0"}],"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","free":true,"CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/Hao-jieDai/LanCarbon-Guide","keywords":["LanCarbon","Jupyter Book","MyST","Markdown"],"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"publish.md","url":"/LanCarbon-Guide/build/publish-fad2603796c3fb5c68a7346e0bf5eac5.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"English","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"rL5rccCH61"}],"identifier":"english","label":"English","html_id":"english","implicit":true,"key":"Ue92AkAe2x"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"First publish","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"key":"mHrlaASYBp"}],"identifier":"first-publish","label":"First publish","html_id":"first-publish","implicit":true,"key":"tVzBynuncF"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build the Book successfully, open Publish, and confirm Git, GitHub CLI, account, build, repository and Pages all pass. Select Publish Website. LanCarbon downloads the connected publication branch into a temporary folder, replaces its website files with the saved _build/html output, adds .nojekyll, creates one Git commit and pushes it to the configured branch.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"sR6UTWoqFE"}],"key":"yxgaB6F8td"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The local managed build and Book source stay unchanged. The temporary publishing folder is removed after success or failure. Publishing updates only the selected Book’s connected branch; it does not delete the repository or alter other branches.","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"KtdMLVdbVs"}],"key":"CcDs7jC28D"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Later updates","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"F0ol3cs7Yp"}],"identifier":"later-updates","label":"Later updates","html_id":"later-updates","implicit":true,"key":"pdtKApdGiE"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"After editing, run Build again first, then select Update Website. If the built files changed, LanCarbon creates and pushes a new commit. If they are identical, no empty commit is created. The panel stores the verified commit and publication time and compares that commit with GitHub during later checks.","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"mJBx7lRVmF"}],"key":"GF0TWUEnWZ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Pages may need a short time to show a new commit. Open Repository to inspect the branch or Open Pages to view the public site. A failed clone, commit or push leaves the remote website at its previous successful revision and reports the failed step.","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"SSY51dvkSG"}],"key":"T12v6bZejg"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"中文","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"GzpQvSeCCb"}],"identifier":"id","label":"中文","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"iunlA2vWNc"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"首次发布","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"key":"DLYmShaSHc"}],"identifier":"id","label":"首次发布","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"NVLDiCn86T"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"先成功 Build Book，再打开 Publish，确认 Git、GitHub CLI、账号、构建、仓库和 Pages 均通过。点击 Publish Website 后，LanCarbon 会把已连接的发布分支下载到临时目录，用保存的 _build/html 替换其中的网站文件，加入 .nojekyll，创建一次 Git 提交并推送到指定分支。","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"key":"Ns1LYvDXMH"}],"key":"zqFZb28gp3"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本地受管理构建与 Book 源文件不会改变。无论成功或失败，临时发布目录都会清理。发布只更新当前 Book 连接的分支，不会删除仓库，也不会修改其他分支。","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"key":"HJQaJ3vxep"}],"key":"z0UYQspp9Z"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"后续更新","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"key":"kUAUBaWl3r"}],"identifier":"id","label":"后续更新","html_id":"id-2","implicit":true,"key":"TdzrL67EqZ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"修改内容后先重新 Build，再点击 Update Website。构建文件有变化时，LanCarbon 会创建并推送新提交；内容完全相同时不会制造空提交。面板保存已核实的提交编号和发布时间，后续检查时会与 GitHub 上的分支进行比较。","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"key":"gwvUPZPC71"}],"key":"Oz65t9ymqA"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Pages 显示新提交可能需要短暂时间。Open Repository 可检查分支，Open Pages 可打开公开网站。下载、提交或推送失败时，远端网站仍停留在上一次成功版本，面板会指出失败步骤。","position":{"start":{"line":32,"column":1},"end":{"line":32,"column":1}},"key":"uNTYYqpZB1"}],"key":"QevkwdxP9y"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Pages subpath / GitHub Pages 子路径","position":{"start":{"line":34,"column":1},"end":{"line":34,"column":1}},"key":"UGIjxGP0Gi"}],"identifier":"github-pages-subpath-github-pages","label":"GitHub Pages subpath / GitHub Pages 子路径","html_id":"github-pages-subpath-github-pages","implicit":true,"key":"n0bD0yBS2r"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"For a project site such as ","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"i5U5yN83mi"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"owner.github.io/repository","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"OCcfbWW9BT"},{"type":"text","value":", LanCarbon creates a separate publication build with ","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"gz3gRTRUnM"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"BASE_URL=/repository","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"MXOFaTj0Fm"},{"type":"text","value":". This makes styles, scripts, navigation and search work below the GitHub Pages subpath without changing the root-based local website.","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"key":"OSkrOX06Im"}],"key":"taEzxEcESb"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"对于 ","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"qcwfCCGgXk"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"owner.github.io/repository","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"eJ6bt89FI9"},{"type":"text","value":" 形式的项目站点，LanCarbon 会使用 ","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"vzY0YkXZYZ"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"BASE_URL=/repository","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"j9IadtsT6p"},{"type":"text","value":" 创建独立的发布构建，使样式、脚本、导航和搜索能够在 GitHub Pages 子路径下工作，同时不改变从根地址访问的本地网站。","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"SDTTjrXSc7"}],"key":"I1cxVwrqhT"}],"key":"ulhm2AXJzJ"}],"key":"H39A9h7uZP"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"GitHub and Pages Setup","url":"/github-pages","group":"LanCarbon Guide"},"next":{"title":"Build and Publishing Workflow","url":"/build-publish-workflow","group":"LanCarbon Guide"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}